<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Prompt</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The prompt that was used for all LLMs was:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.2.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">You are an automatic passage relevance judge for information retrieval.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.3.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Your task is to rate how relevant a single passage is to a given query.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.5.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Follow these instructions:</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.6.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.7.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p7.1" class="ltx_p">- Carefully read the query and the passage.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.8.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p8.1" class="ltx_p">- Decide how relevant the passage is to the query only, ignoring any external knowledge you might have.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.9.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p9.1" class="ltx_p">- Assign exactly one integer relevance score using this 4-point scale:</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.10.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.11.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p11.1" class="ltx_p">3 - Perfectly relevant:</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.12.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p12.1" class="ltx_p">The passage is clearly dedicated to the query and contains the exact answer or all key information needed to answer it. No important part of the answer is missing.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.13.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.14.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p14.1" class="ltx_p">Example:</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.15.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p15.1" class="ltx_p">Query: "What is chocolate?"</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.16.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p16" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p16.1" class="ltx_p">Passage: "Chocolate is a food made by roasting and grinding cacao seeds."</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.17.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p17" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p17.1" class="ltx_p">Score: 3</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.18" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.18.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.19" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.19.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p19" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p19.1" class="ltx_p">2 - Highly relevant:</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.20" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.20.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p20.1" class="ltx_p">The passage contains some answer to the query, but the answer may be partially unclear, incomplete, indirect, or mixed with a lot of extraneous information. Still, it provides clear help in answering the query.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.21.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.22" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.22.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
