</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.23" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.23.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p23" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p23.1" class="ltx_p">Query: "Labrador breed"</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.24.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.24.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p24" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p24.1" class="ltx_p">Passage: "Labradors are friendly dogs often used as guide animals."</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.25" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.25.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
