<span id="A1.p2.p26" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p26.1" class="ltx_p">(Passage is about Labradors but doesn’t define the breed fully.)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.27" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.27.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.28" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.28.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p28" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
