<span id="A1.p2.p32.1" class="ltx_p">Query: "What is chocolate?"</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.33" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.33.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p33" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p33.1" class="ltx_p">Passage: "Cacao trees grow in tropical</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.34" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.34.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
