<span id="A1.p2.p34.1" class="ltx_p">climates."</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.35" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.35.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p35" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p35.1" class="ltx_p">Score: 1 (Related ingredient, but no definition of chocolate.)</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.36" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.36.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.37" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.37.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p37" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
