</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.38" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.38.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.38.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.38.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.p2.1.38.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:324.0pt;">
<span id="A1.p2.p38" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.p2.p38.1" class="ltx_p">The passage has nothing to do with the query or is only extremely weakly related, and it does not help answer the query at all.</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.39" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.39.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A1.p2.1.40" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A1.p2.1.40.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
