<span id="A4.T5.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T5.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T5.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Passage</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T5.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T5.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLM output</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T5.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T5.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:41.4pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Sonnet 4.5</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">anthropological definition of environment</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Man and environment reciprocal relationship. The relationship between humans and environment has varied from the early periods of human settlement on the earth to the present day. The relationship between environment and human beings has also being varying from place to place at any given period of time.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">1</span>
<span id="A4.T5.2.2.4.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The passage discusses the relationship between humans and environment from an anthropological perspective, which is related to the query topic. However, it does not actually provide a definition of “environment” in anthropological terms. It only describes how the human–environment relationship varies across time and space, which is contextual information rather than a definition.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T5.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T5.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:41.4pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">llama3.2:1b</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">cost of interior concrete flooring</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">1 To have a professional complete the epoxy flooring, the price can vary anywhere from $5 to $13 per square foot. 2 An average two car garage can cost anywhere from $2,000 to $5,000 to complete.3 To get an exact price for an installation job, consider using free services such as HomeAdvisor.com. For example, a water-based epoxy paint can retail for $20 to $40. 2 To have a professional complete the epoxy flooring, the price can vary anywhere from $5 to $13 per square foot. 3 An average two car garage can cost anywhere from $2,000 to $5,000 to complete.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">You must assign exactly one integer relevance score.</span>
<span id="A4.T5.2.3.4.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Score: 1</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T5.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T5.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:41.4pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">llama3.1:8b</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">do goldfish grow</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The dolphin fish is the fastest growing wild fish species known to man. When the conditions are right, the dolphin fish can grow as fast as 1.3 to 2.7 inches in a week!That means that in about 1 year, the fish can grow to four feet long and could be as heavy as 40 pounds. Studies have shown that females rarely go over 40 pounds while males can grow to as much as 60 pounds. As a fast-growing fish species, it is also among those which mature early. In fact, dolphin fish are sexually mature in as early as 3 months, some even maturing at just 14 inches long.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T5.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.75pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">You want me to rate the relevance of the passage to the query “do goldfish grow".</span>
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.4.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">After carefully reading both the query and the passage, I assign a score of:</span>
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.4.1.3" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Score: 2</span>
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.4.1.4" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The passage provides clear information about the growth rate of dolphin fish, including their potential size and weight. The passage also mentions that studies have shown females rarely exceed 40 pounds while males can reach up to 60 pounds, which is relevant to the query.</span>
<span id="A4.T5.2.4.4.1.5" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">However, the passage does not directly answer whether goldfish grow or not. It provides general information about dolphin fish’s growth rate but does not provide any direct evidence or examples of goldfish growing. Therefore, I assign a score of 2 instead of 3, indicating that the passage is related to the query but does not provide a definitive answer.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Examples of outputs of models that failed to comply to the prompt. The models fail to only give the relevance score and provide additional justification.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
